2026-07-27T08:20:19.1871986Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:20:19.1931724Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:20:19.1932337Z i /tmp/RtmptvcGIW/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:20:19.1932671Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:20:19.1933053Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:20:19.1933631Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:20:19.1934480Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:20:19.1935258Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:20:19.1935845Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:20:19.2168225Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:19.2274802Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:19.2692232Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:19.2836224Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
